Invalid Log Entries           : 0
Most Frequent Log Type        : INFO
==================================================

--- ERROR LOGS ---
1. 2026-06-06 08:10:45 ERROR - Database connection timeout.
2. 2026-06-06 08:20:11 ERROR - Null pointer exception in module X.
--------------------------------------------------
```

