The application was tested using different scenarios.

| Test Case      | Input              | Expected Result              | Status |
| -------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------- | ------ |
| Valid log file | `server.log`       | Generate summary             | Passed |
| INFO logs      | INFO entries       | Count INFO logs              | Passed |
| WARNING logs   | WARNING entries    | Count WARNING logs           | Passed |
| ERROR logs     | ERROR entries      | Count and display errors     | Passed |
| Empty line     | Blank line         | Ignore line                  | Passed |
| Invalid entry  | Invalid log format | Display warning              | Passed |
| Missing file   | `wrongfile.log`    | Display file-not-found error | Passed |

### Test Result

All required test cases were successfully executed.

