## 15. Conclusion

The **Log File Analyzer** successfully provides an automated solution for analyzing text-based log files.

The application can identify and count INFO, WARNING, and ERROR logs, display ERROR logs separately, determine the most frequent log type, and generate a structured summary report.

The project also demonstrates proper file handling, input validation, and exception handling. Therefore, it provides a simple and effective approach for basic log file analysis using Python.
